<h3>Right to complain</h3>
<p>We ask that you write to us first: we investigate complaints and reply in writing within 1 month. If you disagree with our response, or without writing to us, you may at any time lodge a complaint with the data protection authority of the country where you live (Section 13). A list of EU supervisory authorities is published on the website of the European Data Protection Board (EDPB).</p>
<h3>Language and entry into force</h3>
<p>The Policy is published in all languages supported by the app. In the event of any discrepancy between the texts, the Azerbaijani text prevails, unless local law requires otherwise.</p>
