<h2>14. Changes, contact and right to complain</h2>
<p>We notify you of material changes to the Policy at least 30 days in advance; you can send your questions and complaints to privacy@anacan.az.</p>
<h3>Changes to the Policy</h3>
<ul>
<li>We inform you of material changes (a new purpose, a new data category, a new type of recipient) 30 days in advance by in-app notice and e-mail.</li>
<li>If a change involves using health data for a new purpose, we obtain your new explicit consent; if you do not consent, your data continues to be processed under the previous rules.</li>
<li>Minor amendments (clarifications, typos, contact details) take effect on the day of publication.</li>
<li>You can obtain previous versions by writing to privacy@anacan.az.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Contact</h3>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Matter</th><th>Contact</th></tr></thead>
