<h3>3.4. Emergencies</h3>
<p><strong>If you experience bleeding, severe abdominal pain or headache, visual disturbances, reduced or absent fetal movements, high fever, seizures, breathing difficulties in a child or thoughts of harming yourself, stop using the Service and immediately call your local emergency number (103 in Azerbaijan, 112 in the EU, 911 in the US) or go to the nearest healthcare facility.</strong></p>
<p>The Service is not an emergency service and does not guarantee real-time responses to your messages.</p>

